[by:强氧化的KClO3]
[00:00.00]作词 : Le Li
[00:01.00]作曲 : Le Li
[00:26.57]Glittering tears are falling down on the sidewalk 晶莹的泪珠洒落于人行道上
[00:28.92]Time won't let me wait another day while I'm thinking of 时光不容我再停驻一日 当我仍在思念
[00:32.31]The sadness behind your smile 藏于你笑容后的那份哀伤
[00:37.11]My dreams dissolve like shining rays on the dew drops 我的梦如晨光映露般悄然消融
[00:39.49]Now it's disappeared I know that I can never hold on 如今它已消逝 我明白再无法执守
[00:43.13]To who I thought I would be 那个我曾以为将成为的自己
[00:47.61]Even when my heart is filled with shimmering sorrow 纵然心中溢满微光般闪烁的悲伤
[00:50.62]I can recall memories 我仍能唤起那些
[00:52.00]That last forever 恒久留存的记忆
[00:53.10]Feeling like a new reality in this life without the time we spent together 在这失却与你共度光阴的人生里 仿佛坠入陌生的真实
[00:58.37]Time is shattering the glass of everything that you gave 时光正将你所赋予的一切如琉璃般尽数击碎
[01:01.26]And it's fading away into the shadows 渐渐褪色消散归于幽暗阴影
[01:03.78]Finally I'm feeling like I'm ready to just move on now 终于 我觉得已准备好放下过往继续前行
[01:07.17]THINKING OF 却仍在思念中
[01:08.76]My reflection brightest sunlight ran too far forgot my name 我映照于炽烈日光下 奔逐太远 竟忘却了自己的名字
[01:11.38]Falling tears still shine like dreams turning the pain to brighter days 坠落的泪水依旧如梦般闪耀 将痛楚化作更明澈的时日
[01:14.02]Even if I lose my way as feelings fade they stay the same 即便迷失方向 情感纵然淡去 本质却未曾改变
[01:16.55]May be beaten when I'm broken but I know I'm still shining 纵使破碎之时倍受打击 我明白自己仍在闪耀
[01:19.59]Waking in the morning dreams dissolve before they wait 清晨初醒之际 梦境未及停驻便已消散
[01:22.01]Disappearing memories are something I just can't translate 那些渐行渐远的记忆 是我难以言说的心绪
[01:24.64]Feel the pain but that's OK I keep on wishing once again 即使感受痛楚也无妨 我仍会反复许下心愿
[01:27.40]Just as long as I'm here to stay 只要依然立于此间
[01:28.89]I know I'M STILL SHINING 我明白自己仍在闪耀
[01:34.32]I'M STILL SHINING 我仍在闪耀
